The definitive fix for preserving transparency with `imagecopyresampled` is:
1.  Ensure `imagesavealpha` is true for both source and target (the snippet only sets it for the target). You must call `imagesavealpha($srcImage, true)` as well, though `imagecreatefrompng` usually handles this automatically in newer GD versions, explicit setting is safer.
